      "text": "Teddy Roosevelt dubbed Grand View Drive the “World’s Most Beautiful Drive” in 1910, a title it still proudly carries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
